# has propagated (verify with `dig +short api.spidnums.com` before
# uncommenting — Caddy will otherwise retry ACME issuance against a
# non-resolving domain indefinitely, which is harmless to the working
# test.spidnums.com block above but pointless log noise until the record is
# live). Identical to the block above; kept as a literal duplicate rather
# than a shared snippet so the two can diverge later (e.g. dropping
